{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/b3ab0ea0becfd77e975ac7c4e48c1365.avif?t=1757350606\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >//\u00a0<strong>PREMISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a low level delivery goon for a shady research company running what should've been a simple drop off. But the &quot;intel&quot; in your bag? It's actually a module for building evil robots. And thanks to your incompetence, you've just been captured by rebels trying to steal it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/ce43ef30c928b2d752279cadd3ea9e7a.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... now they\u2019re dead set on cracking open your mind until you spill everything they want to know.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// YOUR DESKTOP COMPANION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BBY DON'T HURT ME</strong> is a furry interactive desktop companion that sits on your screen\u2019s edge and delivers insulting remarks as you work or browse.\u00a0They want to break you. They want control. And they\u2019ll smile while doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/1dd7928bb56e5f269ca0d7cff86d708a.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/22cc8a9b675b3e5c72590c3c7e9f247a.avif?t=1757350606\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// FEATURED VOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four fully animated personalities with three degrees of burn: Rare, Medium, and Cooked. Delivered to you by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Vera Tan // Havoc (Shark)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Nola Klop // Octavic (Fox)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Michael Kovach // Waveform (Poodle)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Max Herzfeld // Litany (Wolf)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/e825654346d1b5127df3162cae2bf056.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1600 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/03ddd9e68b7f59fbfc0179554d4ed953.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/b289299ddf284b0c668654793c056335.avif?t=1757350606\" width=615 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// MODDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who wouldn\u2019t want to bring their own OC to life in a game? <strong>BBY DON\u2019T HURT ME</strong> makes it easy for streamers and users with Live2D support. It also comes with a simple level editor so users wont need to touch the codebase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload a .csv of custom voicelines and pair them with your own audio recordings to give your character a real voice in game. View and share mods on our community Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/c449ea848174bba488646dc952d20dc8.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/e43b512bfee83230553433c02ab661b7.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// FULL SCREEN MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up close and personal? <strong>BBY DONT HURT ME</strong> supports full screen mode with fully animated Live2D characters featuring <strong>320+ unique dialogue lines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/extras/27a2703704c66fb43ef8cdde39b14788.avif?t=1757350606\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916540?t=1757350606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916540?t=1757350606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/73b213e80e4747c01ba9e151d1001c7b45833821/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757350606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916540/73b213e80e4747c01ba9e151d1001c7b45833821/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757350606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"While there are no explicit sexual acts or nudity depicted, the game contains strong language, adult themes, and suggestive dialogue. Players may